* @file           : main.c
* @brief          : BYPASS BUILD — Throttle ADC (PC1) -> DAC (PA4 + PA5)
*                   Both DAC channels driven for dual motor input.
*                   With 0.5V minimum floor + verbose debug printout.
*
* Active path:
*   PC1 (ADC1_IN7) -> throttle_raw -> throttle_to_dac()
*       -> PA4 (DAC1_OUT1)  motor 1
*       -> PA5 (DAC1_OUT2)  motor 2
*
* Mapping:
*   ADC <= THROTTLE_ADC_MIN  -> DAC = DAC_OUT_MIN  (~0.5V at PA4/PA5)
*   ADC >= THROTTLE_ADC_MAX  -> DAC = DAC_OUT_MAX  (3.3V at PA4/PA5)
*   In between               -> linear scale
*
* Active CAN: steering (0x040), throttle (0x2C8)
* Bypassed:   AS5600 #2/#3, ADXL #1/#2, Hall RPM
******************************************************************************
*/
